{% lede %}
Clowning runs on timing, and so does photographing it. Since 2024 I've been the unofficial house photographer at Church of Clown, San Francisco's comedy club and clown school, shooting solo shows, cabarets and the annual Flop Festival.
{% /lede %}

The light is low and colored, the performers move fast, and the best moment usually lasts a fraction of a second: a spit take, a leap, a face pressed through plastic wrap. I shoot from the audience during live shows and edit each show into its own album on Flickr.

Top: Lil Wenker in *Bangtail*, co-created and directed by Cecily Nash (November 2024), and an act from Clown Cabaret (December 2025).
